	(text_box "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1x\n\n*In module variants that have embedded OSPI PSRAM, i.e., that embed ESP32-S3R8, pins IO35, IO36 and IO37 are connected to the OSPI PSRAM and are not available for other uses.\n\nNote:\nESP32-S3 has four strapping pins: GPIO0, GPIO3, GPIO45 and GPIO46.\n\nGPIO0, GPIO45 and GPIO46 are connected to the chip's internal weak pull-up/pull-down during the chip reset.\n\nGPIO3 is floating by default."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
